1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,510
One important exception.

2
00:00:01,510 --> 00:00:11,210
When the question word is itself the subject, there is no inversion and no do: someone broke the window becomes who broke the window, not who did break.

3
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:19,088
But when it replaces the object, you invert: you met someone becomes whom did you meet, or less formally, who did you meet?

